# The left trigger is a right click past half; the right trigger keeps its analog value and adds Z then X by depth.
setup tests/scenarios/packs/input.padpack Triggers
trigger left 0.4
trigger left 0.6
trigger left 0
trigger right 0.4
trigger right 0.9
trigger right 0
---
mouse Right down           @0
mouse Right up             @0
pad-axis RightTrigger 0.40 @0
key KEY_Z down             @0
pad-axis RightTrigger 0.90 @0
key KEY_Z up               @0
key KEY_X down             @0
pad-axis RightTrigger 0.00 @0
key KEY_X up               @0
